### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

January 8, 2025
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-11-25 for Two (2) Solid Waste Transfer Trailers (Walking
Floor) for the Sanitation Division
______________________________________________
Bid #E-11-25 was solicited for Two (2) Solid Waste Transfer Trailers (Walking Floor) for the
Sanitation Division.

One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received from:
1. Ameri-Tech Equipment Company, Cheyenne, Wyoming

The bid was reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), Austin Reiner
(Sanitation), and Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance), and their recommendation is to accept the lowest
responsive bid from Ameri-Tech Equipment Company.

The total Bid Award is for $275,968.22 (Purchase of 2 Trailers, Less Trade-In).

Funding:
023-14-1417-43-43102 (Solid Waste Fund / Equipment)
```

